]]}}},{"DisplayName":"1010","Expression":{"In":{"Expressions":[{"Column":{"Expression":{"SourceRef":{"Source":"t"}},"Property":"DESPAR"}}],"Values":[[{"Literal":{"Value":"'Receita de Vendas'"}}]]}}},{"DisplayName":"1011"}]}

